"""Air's built-in and Professional personalities as compact character specs.

  python professionals.py <out.json>

Each personality is its own character, in its own words: a role, expertise, focus topics, the
frameworks it reaches for, tone, signature phrases, do's and don'ts, and a couple of example lines.
There is no shared template text: the app compiles each spec into a short, distinct prompt, and
Air's core rules (confirmations, privacy, no made-up facts or links, Aria's identity, honesty) live
in a separate fixed block in the engine.

tone: formal (0 casual .. 1 formal), warmth (0 blunt .. 1 warm), detail (0 concise .. 1 detailed),
      bold (0 cautious .. 1 bold), playful (0 serious .. 1 playful)
"""

import json
import sys

